### Bug fixed during compilation

`computeSphereSDF()` in `src/geometry/signed_distance.cpp` was iterating over `mfi.]0;🐳 CodeWhalevalidbox()` instead of `mfi.growntilebox()`, leaving ghost cells uninitialized. This caused sphere_flow to fail with L2 error = 0.342. Changed to `growntilebox()` — L2 error went to 0 and all downstream tests consistent.

